 plan. Every[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]implementer receives them mechanically, and a plan authorizes a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]memory edit only through an accepted memory decision.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]9[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]plan_decisions.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/plan_decisions.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1hi[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1hi/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase-core decisions grammar, resolver, quote matcher, and [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]Decision Sheet[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: in the linked sase-core repo, add the `decisions:` grammar and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]diagnostics (including the system-written [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`answer`/`decided_by`/`decided_via` fields, a new Archived validation [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mode, branch callouts, and the reserved `phases[].when`), the additive [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validated-plan wire, the frozen payload definition record, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]default/clamp resolver, the human-quote matcher, the Decision Sheet with[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]its summary sentence and implementer prompt block, a definitions digest,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and pyo3 bindings with tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Durable human-authorship provenance for prompts and gate [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]answers[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]provenance[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]provenance: record `prompt_origin` on every agent launch and `caller` on[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every gate response, then add one gatherer that returns only [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]human-written text from a planner's chain (typed root prompt, human [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]feedback bullets, human free-text Q&A answers), failing closed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]everywhere.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Compile, resolve, freeze, and stamp decisions in the plan gate[bold white on #D75F87][/bold #D7AFFF] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]gate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core, provenance[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate: move the sase-core pin, adapt the Python wire and Archived mode, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scaffold the `plan_decisions` beta flag, resolve memory scope and verify[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]quotes at validate/propose/gate build, compile `decision_<id>` raw [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]schema properties and `payload.decisions`, pin them in kind validation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]normalize inputs before the receipt, bind submissions to the displayed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]review revision, freeze definitions during review, carry provisional [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]values into feedback replans, and stamp immutable answers into the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]durable plan on every approval route.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Deliver accepted decisions to coders, phases, notifications, [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]and receipts[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]handoff[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]handoff: append the host-written Reviewer decisions block to tale coder [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompts, show DECISIONS in `sase bead read` and the phase/land macros, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]carry an epic's accepted decisions into phase sub-plans, post the quiet [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`%auto` receipt notification, and add the shared Rich decision display [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]builders.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Decision-aware sase plan and sase gate commands[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after handoff[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: add `sase plan approve -D/--decide ID=VALUE` with live completions,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the decision card, dry-run, retry and agent-boundary messages, plus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decision output for `plan show`, `plan list`, `plan validate`, `plan [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]propose`, and `gate show`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]ACE Decisions section, compact Verdict, and decision-aware [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]inbox[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]tui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after handoff[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui: build the ACE Decisions accordion above a compact docked Verdict [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with the outcome sentence, new gate keys, a document pane that folds the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]frontmatter and lights the chosen branch, draft persistence, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]revision-bound submits on every path, a settled-elsewhere state, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]toast/inbox/gate-card/PLAN-lane decision rendering, and new visual [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Telegram decision sheet, live keyboard, and settle receipt[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]telegram[dim] · [dim][/dim]after handoff[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]telegram: in the linked sase-telegram repo, render the static question [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sheet, the live set-value decision keyboard with choice sub-keyboards [/#D7D